::page[route="/" title="Bakery"]

::hero[align=center]
# Bread worth getting up early for
The Saltmere Sourdough Box brings two fresh loaves and a pastry to your door each week.
[Order a box](/contact){primary}
[See prices](/prices)
::

::features[cols=3]
### Baked at dawn
Every loaf leaves the oven before six and is on the shelf by seven.
### Local flour
The Saltmere Sourdough Box uses stoneground flour from the mill upriver.
### No shortcuts
Our dough ferments for a full day and contains only flour, water and salt.
::

::

::page[route="/pricing" title="Pricing"]

# Boxes and loaves

Weekly boxes are delivered on Saturday morning.

::pricing-table
| Option | Price | Includes |
|--------|-------|----------|
| Saltmere Sourdough Box | $18 | Two loaves and a pastry each week |
| Family Box | $31 | Four loaves and six pastries each week |
| Single Loaf | $7 | One country loaf from the counter |
::

::faq
### Do you deliver?
Yes. We deliver anywhere inside the harbour wall.
### Can I pause my box?
You can pause or cancel any week before Thursday noon.
### Do you bake gluten free bread?
Not yet. Our kitchen handles wheat every day.
::

